  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A dihydroxy-5β-cholanic acid that is chenodeoxycholic acid carrying an additional ethyl substituent at the 6α-position. A semi-synthetic bile acid which acts as a farnesoid X receptor agonist and is used for treatment of primary biliary cholangitis."
  ],
